OL,3,GNEWSAFour more arrests over stabbing of
OL,4,Aboy, 13
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour more arrests have been made in
OL,7,Fconnection with the stabbing of a
OL,8,F13-year-old boy in a town centre.
OL,10,FThe victim was attacked near the
OL,11,FRiverside Shopping Centre in Rochdale
OL,12,Fon Saturday evening and remains in
OL,13,Fhospital with serious injuries, which
OL,14,Fare not said to be life-threatening or
OL,15,Flife-changing.
OL,17,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP)
OL,18,Farrested four teenage boys on suspicion
OL,19,Fof assault and possession weapon, while
OL,20,Ftwo other teenagers held on suspicion
OL,21,Fof the same offences have been released
OL,22,Fon bail.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
